      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "GET ${TARGET_URL}/Error/NotFound" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "-" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "panel",
        "attrs": { "panelType": "info" },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Description",
                "marks": [{ "type": "strong" }]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 4 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Description" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "The server is returning a verbose ASP.NET exception and stack trace directly in the HTTP response because <customErrors mode=\"Off\"/> is enabled. This allows detailed standard errors to be displayed to remote users rather than generic error messages." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 4 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Impact" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "The response reveals sensitive internal application details, including ASP.NET MVC and Web Forms internals, view locations (e.g., views_shared_site_master), and authentication implementation details like GenericIdentity and FormsIdentity. This information aids attackers in mapping the internal request-processing flow and identifying underlying unhandled exceptions." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "panel",
        "attrs": { "panelType": "warning" },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Step to Reproduce",
                "marks": [{ "type": "strong" }]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Navigate to the following URL: ${TARGET_URL}/Error/NotFound" }]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Observe the verbose ASP.NET error message and stack trace returned in the response body." }]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "-" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "panel",
        "attrs": { "panelType": "note" },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "POC (Proof of Concept)",
                "marks": [{ "type": "strong" }]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Request:" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "curl -i ${TARGET_URL}/Error/NotFound", "marks": [{ "type": "code" }] }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Response Example Snippet:" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "codeBlock",
        "attrs": { "language": "text" },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "[InvalidCastException: Unable to cast object of type 'System.Security.Principal.GenericIdentity' to type 'System.Web.Security.FormsIdentity'.]\nASP.views_shared_site_master.__RenderSiteMaster(HtmlTextWriter __w, Control parameterContainer) in c:\\\\...\\\\Views\\\\Shared\\\\Site.Master:12"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "-" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "panel",
        "attrs": { "panelType": "success" },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Recommendation",
                "marks": [{ "type": "strong" }]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Configure production error handling to log detailed exceptions server-side while returning generic messages to remote clients. Update the web.config as follows:" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "codeBlock",
        "attrs": { "language": "xml" },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<system.web>\n  <customErrors mode=\"RemoteOnly\" defaultRedirect=\"~/Error\" />\n  <compilation debug=\"false\" />\n</system.web>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Additionally, verify IIS <httpErrors> behavior and implement a generic error handler that checks identity types before performing casts." }]
      }
    ]
  }
